<p data-start=3D"5708" data-end=3D"5813" class=3D"">Docker Swarm est un out=
il d=E2=80=99orchestration int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9 =C3=A0 Docker, permettant de g=
=C3=A9rer un cluster de conteneurs.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5815" data-end=3D"5945">
<li data-start=3D"5815" data-end=3D"5859" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5817" data-end=3D"5859" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
817" data-end=3D"5837">Cr=C3=A9er un cluster</strong> : <code data-start=3D=
