<li data-start=3D"6206" data-end=3D"6251" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6208" data-end=3D"6251" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
208" data-end=3D"6219">Service</strong> : G=C3=A8re l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s r=
=C3=A9seau aux pods.</p>
