<p data-start=3D"4347" data-end=3D"4501" class=3D"">Nous utilisons l'image =
<code data-start=3D"4370" data-end=3D"4379">node:14</code> pour installer l=
es d=C3=A9pendances et construire l'application. Le r=C3=A9pertoire <code d=
ata-start=3D"4454" data-end=3D"4460">/app</code> est utilis=C3=A9 comme r=
=C3=A9pertoire de travail.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4505" data-end=3D"4630" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4507" data-end=3D"4630" class=3D"">Apr=C3=A8s avoir copi=
=C3=A9 le <code data-start=3D"4528" data-end=3D"4542">package.json</code> e=
t le <code data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4568">package-lock.json</code>, =
nous ex=C3=A9cutons <code data-start=3D"4585" data-end=3D"4598">npm install=
</code> pour installer les d=C3=A9pendances.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4634" data-end=3D"4798" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4636" data-end=3D"4798" class=3D"">Nous copions ensuite to=
ut le code source de l'application et ex=C3=A9cutons <code data-start=3D"47=
07" data-end=3D"4722">npm run build</code> pour g=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer la versio=
n optimis=C3=A9e de l'application dans le dossier <code data-start=3D"4790"=
 data-end=3D"4797">build</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4803" data-end=3D"5251" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4806" data-end=3D"4841" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
806" data-end=3D"4839">=C3=89tape 2 - Image de production</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4845" data-end=3D"5251">
<li data-start=3D"4845" data-end=3D"4988" class=3D"">
