dossier <code data-start=3D"5090" data-end=3D"5097">build</code> et le doss=
ier <code data-start=3D"5112" data-end=3D"5126">node_modules</code> (qui co=
ntient les d=C3=A9pendances n=C3=A9cessaires en production).</p>
