<li data-start=3D"1394" data-end=3D"1479" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1396" data-end=3D"1479" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
396" data-end=3D"1426">=C3=89viter la perte de donn=C3=A9es</strong> en cas=
 de suppression d'un conteneur ou d=E2=80=99un volume.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1480" data-end=3D"1536" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1482" data-end=3D"1536" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
482" data-end=3D"1508">Faciliter la migration</strong> entre machines ou se=
rveurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1537" data-end=3D"1605" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1539" data-end=3D"1605" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
539" data-end=3D"1567">Restaurer un =C3=A9tat stable</strong> apr=C3=A8s un=
e mise =C3=A0 jour ou un incident.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1606" data-end=3D"1678" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1608" data-end=3D"1678" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
608" data-end=3D"1635">Conserver un historique</strong> pour r=C3=A9cup=C3=
=A9rer des donn=C3=A9es plus anciennes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1680" data-end=3D"1683" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1685" data-end=3D"1723" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1688" data-end=3D"1723">2. Sauvegarder un volume Docker</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1724" data-end=3D"1888" class=3D"">Docker ne fournit pas d=
