<li data-start=3D"2625" data-end=3D"2711" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2627" data-end=3D"2711" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"262=
7" data-end=3D"2644">docker run --rm</code> : Cr=C3=A9e un conteneur tempor=
aire qui sera supprim=C3=A9 une fois termin=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2712" data-end=3D"2800" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2714" data-end=3D"2800" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"271=
4" data-end=3D"2743">-v my_database_volume:/data</code> : Monte le volume D=
ocker dans le conteneur sous <code data-start=3D"2792" data-end=3D"2799">/d=
ata</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2801" data-end=3D"2911" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2803" data-end=3D"2911" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"280=
3" data-end=3D"2822">-v $(pwd):/backup</code> : Monte le r=C3=A9pertoire co=
