<h3 data-start=3D"2015" data-end=3D"2032" class=3D"">Explication :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2033" data-end=3D"2601">
<li data-start=3D"2033" data-end=3D"2117" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2035" data-end=3D"2117" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
035" data-end=3D"2046">Version</strong> : Sp=C3=A9cifie la version de Docke=
r Compose =C3=A0 utiliser (ici, version 3.8).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2118" data-end=3D"2493" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2120" data-end=3D"2174" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
120" data-end=3D"2132">Services</strong> : D=C3=A9finit les services Docker=
 =C3=A0 ex=C3=A9cuter.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2177" data-end=3D"2493">
<li data-start=3D"2177" data-end=3D"2288" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2179" data-end=3D"2288" class=3D"">Le service <code data-s=
tart=3D"2190" data-end=3D"2195">web</code> utilise l=E2=80=99image <code da=
ta-start=3D"2212" data-end=3D"2219">nginx</code>, expose le port 8080 de l'=
h=C3=B4te, et le mappe au port 80 du conteneur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2291" data-end=3D"2493" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2293" data-end=3D"2493" class=3D"">Le service <code data-s=
tart=3D"2304" data-end=3D"2308">db</code> utilise l=E2=80=99image <code dat=
a-start=3D"2325" data-end=3D"2332">mysql</code>, d=C3=A9finit des variables=
 d=E2=80=99environnement (comme le mot de passe root et le nom de la base d=
e donn=C3=A9es) et les services sont connect=C3=A9s au m=C3=AAme r=C3=A9sea=
u <code data-start=3D"2479" data-end=3D"2492">app_network</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2494" data-end=3D"2601" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2496" data-end=3D"2601" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
496" data-end=3D"2508">Networks</strong> : Cr=C3=A9e un r=C3=A9seau <code d=
ata-start=3D"2526" data-end=3D"2534">bridge</code> personnalis=C3=A9 afin q=
ue les services puissent communiquer entre eux.</p>
</li>
</ul>
