<p data-start=3D"3056" data-end=3D"3102" class=3D"">D=C3=A9marre les conten=
eurs en arri=C3=A8re-plan (<code data-start=3D"3096" data-end=3D"3100">-d</=
code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3103" data-end=3D"3156" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3106" data-end=3D"3156" class=3D"">Reconstruit les images,=
 si n=C3=A9cessaire (<code data-start=3D"3145" data-end=3D"3154">--build</c=
ode>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3157" data-end=3D"3268" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3160" data-end=3D"3268" class=3D"">Supprime les conteneurs=
 orphelins qui ne sont pas dans le fichier <code data-start=3D"3226" data-e=
nd=3D"3246">docker-compose.yml</code> (<code data-start=3D"3248" data-end=
=3D"3266">--remove-orphans</code>).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3270" data-end=3D"3273" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3275" data-end=3D"3322" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3278" data-end=3D"3322">2. Pr=C3=A9sentation de <code data-start=3D"3299" d=
ata-end=3D"3320">docker-compose down</code></strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3324" data-end=3D"3374" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3328" data-end=3D"3374">2.1. Qu'est-ce que <code data-start=3D"3349" data-e=
nd=3D"3370">docker-compose down</code> ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3376" data-end=3D"3589" class=3D"">La commande <code data-=
start=3D"3388" data-end=3D"3409">docker-compose down</code> est utilis=C3=
=A9e pour arr=C3=AAter et supprimer tous les conteneurs, r=C3=A9seaux et vo=
lumes cr=C3=A9=C3=A9s par <code data-start=3D"3499" data-end=3D"3518">docke=
r-compose up</code>. Elle permet de nettoyer l'environnement de travail en =
toute s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3591" data-end=3D"3835" class=3D"">Contrairement =C3=A0 <c=
ode data-start=3D"3607" data-end=3D"3628">docker-compose stop</code> qui ar=
r=C3=AAte seulement les conteneurs, <code data-start=3D"3666" data-end=3D"3=
687">docker-compose down</code> supprime tout ce qui a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 cr=C3=
=A9=C3=A9, y compris les r=C3=A9seaux et les volumes associ=C3=A9s, sauf si=
 vous utilisez des options pour conserver certains =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3837" data-end=3D"3865" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3841" data-end=3D"3865">2.2. Syntaxe de base</strong></h3>
