<p data-start=3D"955" data-end=3D"1107" class=3D"">Avant de commencer, vous=
 devez avoir Docker et Docker Compose install=C3=A9s sur votre machine. Si =
ce n'est pas d=C3=A9j=C3=A0 fait, suivez ces =C3=A9tapes d'installation :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"1109" data-end=3D"1249">
<li data-start=3D"1109" data-end=3D"1172" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1111" data-end=3D"1172" class=3D""><a data-start=3D"1111" =
data-end=3D"1172" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"cursor-pointer"=
>Installation de Docker</a></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1173" data-end=3D"1249" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1175" data-end=3D"1249" class=3D""><a data-start=3D"1175" =
data-end=3D"1249" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"cursor-pointer"=
>Installation de Docker Compose</a></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1251" data-end=3D"1254" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"1256" data-end=3D"1292" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1259" data-end=3D"1292">2. Structure de l'application</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1294" data-end=3D"1342" class=3D"">Notre application consi=
stera en trois services :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1344" data-end=3D"1568">
<li data-start=3D"1344" data-end=3D"1399" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1346" data-end=3D"1399" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
346" data-end=3D"1355">Nginx</strong> : un serveur web pour servir l'applic=
ation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1400" data-end=3D"1459" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1402" data-end=3D"1459" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
402" data-end=3D"1411">MySQL</strong> : une base de donn=C3=A9es pour stock=
er des donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1460" data-end=3D"1568" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1462" data-end=3D"1568" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
462" data-end=3D"1488">Node.js (avec Express)</strong> : un backend pour g=
=C3=A9rer les requ=C3=AAtes HTTP et interagir avec la base de donn=C3=A9es.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
