4012" data-end=3D"4059">2.5. Utiliser des images multi-stage builds</strong=
></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4061" data-end=3D"4390" class=3D"">Les builds multi-stage =
permettent de diviser la construction de votre image en plusieurs =C3=A9tap=
