<h3 data-start=3D"6761" data-end=3D"6803" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6765" data-end=3D"6803">3.2. Choisir des images s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9es</stron=
g></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6805" data-end=3D"7067" class=3D"">Il est important de cho=
isir des images de base s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9es et bien maintenues. Par exempl=
