g></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7350" data-end=3D"7417" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7354" data-end=3D"7417">4.1. Minimiser l'utilisation de <code data-start=3D=
"7388" data-end=3D"7393">ADD</code> et privil=C3=A9gier <code data-start=3D=
"7409" data-end=3D"7415">COPY</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7419" data-end=3D"7737" class=3D"">L'instruction <code dat=
