<ol data-start=3D"4235" data-end=3D"4434">
<li data-start=3D"4235" data-end=3D"4342" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4238" data-end=3D"4342" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
238" data-end=3D"4273">G=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer des certificats SSL/TLS</strong> p=
our s=C3=A9curiser la communication entre le client Docker et le daemon.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4343" data-end=3D"4434" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4346" data-end=3D"4434" class=3D"">Configurer le d=C3=A9mo=
n Docker pour =C3=A9couter uniquement sur des interfaces r=C3=A9seau s=C3=
=A9curis=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ol>
