<h3 data-start=3D"4773" data-end=3D"4832" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4777" data-end=3D"4832">2.3. Activer et configurer le mode "Swarm" avec TLS=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4834" data-end=3D"5063" class=3D"">Docker Swarm permet de =
g=C3=A9rer un cluster de machines Docker et il est essentiel de s=C3=A9curi=
ser la communication entre les n=C5=93uds. Pour ce faire, vous devez active=
r <strong data-start=3D"4994" data-end=3D"5001">TLS</strong> pour s=C3=A9cu=
riser les communications entre les n=C5=93uds du cluster.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5065" data-end=3D"5068" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5070" data-end=3D"5121" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5073" data-end=3D"5121">3. S=C3=A9curiser Docker au niveau des conteneurs</=
strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5123" data-end=3D"5183" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5127" data-end=3D"5183">3.1. Utiliser des options de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des=
 conteneurs</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5185" data-end=3D"5316" class=3D"">Docker offre plusieurs =
m=C3=A9canismes pour renforcer la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des conteneurs, tels q=
ue les options <code data-start=3D"5283" data-end=3D"5295">--cap-drop</code=
> et <code data-start=3D"5299" data-end=3D"5315">--security-opt</code>.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"5318" data-end=3D"5355" class=3D"">Exemples d'options de =
s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5357" data-end=3D"5503">
<li data-start=3D"5357" data-end=3D"5503" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5359" data-end=3D"5503" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
359" data-end=3D"5396">D=C3=A9sactiver les capacit=C3=A9s inutiles</strong>=
 : Utilisez <code data-start=3D"5408" data-end=3D"5420">--cap-drop</code> p=
our retirer des capacit=C3=A9s syst=C3=A8me inutiles, r=C3=A9duisant ainsi =
la surface d'attaque.</p>
</li>
</ul>
