<h3 data-start=3D"6882" data-end=3D"6934" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6886" data-end=3D"6934">2.5. Scaling et orchestration des conteneurs</stron=
g></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6936" data-end=3D"7263" class=3D"">Dans un environnement d=
e production, il est souvent n=C3=A9cessaire de g=C3=A9rer plusieurs instan=
