<li data-start=3D"1298" data-end=3D"1405" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1300" data-end=3D"1405" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
300" data-end=3D"1312">R=C3=A9plicas</strong> : Plusieurs instances d'un m=
=C3=AAme service pour la tol=C3=A9rance aux pannes et la mise =C3=A0 l'=C3=
=A9chelle.</p>
</li>
</ul>
