<hr data-start=3D"4435" data-end=3D"4438" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4440" data-end=3D"4474" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4443" data-end=3D"4474">3. Mise =C3=A0 Jour d'un Service</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4476" data-end=3D"4693" class=3D"">Docker Swarm permet de =
mettre =C3=A0 jour un service sans arr=C3=AAter l'application. Lors de la m=
ise =C3=A0 jour, Docker Swarm d=C3=A9ploie les nouvelles versions des conte=
neurs un =C3=A0 un, afin de garantir que le service reste disponible.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4695" data-end=3D"4732" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4699" data-end=3D"4732">3.1. Mettre =C3=A0 Jour un Service</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4734" data-end=3D"4898" class=3D"">Si vous avez une nouvel=
